  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Domas sceolon beon butan ælcere hadarunge: þæt ys, þæt he ne murne naðer ne rycum ne heanum, ne leofum ne laðum folcriht to recceanne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Judgements are to be made without regard for the individual: that is, he [the judge] is not to care whether [the accused] is rich or poor, a friend or enemy – full legal rights are to be extended [to all].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Iudicia debent esse sine omni haderunga, cur non parcatur alicui diuiti uel egeno, amico uel inimico ius publicum recitari.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
